Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=('15fdf82444d1f92e1a9b9a1a10d1606fa8dd1995c5c369e84af7cea8c5c76e75',), event=Revised(decision='ciworkflows', at=datetime(2026, 11, 20, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title="CI: the private repository checks master and builds the APK; core's runners run the gate's tree half and the publication", body="*A release is a `v<version>` tag*, made by `train.sh land` alone. Each workflow, what starts it, and whose runners run it (`scripts/core-settings.sh` turns on only `gate.yml`, `gate-store.yml` and `publication.yml` in suzatary-core, and `gate-store.yml`, `gate-passes.yml` and `publication.yml` skip in a private repository):\n- `quick.yml`, on a push to master or a dispatch, in the private repository: the commit-message check, then fmt, clippy and docs from `cargo` against a restored dependency build with one set of flags (`.github/cargo-ci.toml`), not run again on git tree entries that already passed, so a docs change costs the commit check alone.\n- `release-apk.yml`, on a `v*` tag or a dispatch, in the private repository: the APK, built only when the Android shell (`android/`, `nix/apk.nix`, `nix/apk-profile.nix`, the icon) changed since the previous tag or the tag starts a new MAJOR (the owner, 2026-10-13), since the web app updates itself behind the portal.\n- `update-flake-lock.yml`, weekly or on a dispatch, in the private repository: a pull request that moves `flake.lock` and rides a train.\n- `gate.yml`, on a push to a `gate/**` branch of core: the merge gate's tree half, one lane per job (`gatehalves`, `train`).\n- `gate-store.yml`, on a push to core's master: the Nix store and the cargo dependency build the gate's jobs restore.\n- `gate-passes.yml`, when a Gate run in core completes: the passes its jobs kept, for the next gate (`gatekeptpasses`); `core-settings.sh` does not name it, so a run of that script turns it off.\n- `publication.yml`, on a push to core's master or the train's dispatch: what a deploy builds, pushed to the Cachix the box substitutes from (`publication`).\n\nThe live half, the deploy and every step that reads the private repository stay on the box.", rationale="September 2026's included Actions minutes ran out, so the private repository's own runs are sized to one push; a public repository's runners cost nothing, so the tree half and the deploy's builds run in core. The owner, 2026-10-13, on the APK. Restated 2026-11-20: the tag-time build workflow was deleted on 2026-11-19, and the gate's workflows run in core.", supersedes=()))